**Cyclic subgroup separability and virtual specialness conjecture.** The following conditions on $G$ should be equivalent:

- $G$ is cyclic subgroup separable;
- $G$ has a finite-index subgroup with isolated edge groups;
- $G$ is virtually compact special.

Furthermore, if $G$ is freely indecomposable, then $G$ is cyclic subgroup separable if and only if it is residually finite and non-solvable.

